# Scenario authoring guide

A scenario is a reusable unit of production experience.

```text
incident / expert warning
        ↓
condition
        ↓
scenario
        ↓
executable or declared check
        ↓
evidence
        ↓
gate
```

## Good

```yaml
id: BILL-001
title: Duplicate webhook processing is idempotent
checks:
  - path: billing.duplicate_webhook_tested
    operator: equals
    value: true
    on_fail: HOLD
```

## Weak

```yaml
check: billing looks okay
```

Scenarios should be narrow enough that a failed result points to a concrete next action.
